{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"出埃及記","commonName":"出埃及記","title":"出埃及記","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"975f8d6f5a961502e0544f5845356bd86e40024b75e074eaca3a53bffa657137","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1212},"chapter":{"number":11,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["所有頭胎的都死"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對摩西說：「我再使一樣的災殃臨到法老和埃及，然後他必容你們離開這地。他容你們去的時候，總要催逼你們都從這地出去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你要傳於百姓的耳中，叫他們男女各人向鄰舍要金器銀器。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華叫百姓在埃及人眼前蒙恩，並且摩西在埃及地、法老臣僕，和百姓的眼中看為極大。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["摩西說：「耶和華這樣說：『約到半夜，我必出去巡行埃及遍地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["凡在埃及地，從坐寶座的法老直到磨子後的婢女所有的長子，以及一切頭生的牲畜，都必死。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["埃及遍地必有大哀號；從前沒有這樣的，後來也必沒有。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["至於以色列中，無論是人是牲畜，連狗也不敢向他們搖舌，好叫你們知道耶和華是將埃及人和以色列人分別出來。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你這一切臣僕都要俯伏來見我，說：『求你和跟從你的百姓都出去』，然後我要出去。」於是，摩西氣忿忿地離開法老，出去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和華對摩西說：「法老必不聽你們，使我的奇事在埃及地多起來。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["摩西、亞倫在法老面前行了這一切奇事；耶和華使法老的心剛硬，不容以色列人出離他的地。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/11.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/12.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/10.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}